    <section class="college-guide" aria-labelledby="college-guide-title">
      <h2 id="college-guide-title">Private Engineering Colleges · B.Tech Admissions</h2>
      <p>A curated India-wide guide to major private engineering colleges and their B.Tech entrance routes. Dates below are for the 2026 admission cycle; schedules and eligibility can change by campus, programme, and counselling round. Check the official admission page for the latest notice.</p>
      <div class="college-compare-cta"><div><strong>Compare colleges side by side</strong><span>Review campus scale, placements, NIRF rank and admission details.</span></div><a href="/compare-colleges">Open college comparison <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      <div class="college-table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="B.Tech college admissions table" tabindex="0">
        <table class="college-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">College / campus</th>
              <th scope="col">B.Tech entrance route</th>
              <th scope="col">2026 application window</th>
              <th scope="col">2026 exam window</th>
              <th scope="col">Result / status</th>
              <th scope="col">Official link</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
